# Required for the Contact and Enroll Now forms to send email via Resend.
# 1. Sign up at resend.com if you haven't already.
# 2. Verify a sending domain (e.g. idealhh.com or a subdomain like mail.idealhh.com)
#    under Resend → Domains — this requires adding a few DNS records.
# 3. Generate an API key under Resend → API Keys.
# 4. Add it here for local dev, and in DigitalOcean App Platform →
#    Settings → App-Level Environment Variables for production.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
